01:07:47.302 --> 01:07:50.830
Okay, anything else that
we wanna say before I go--

01:07:50.830 --> 01:07:53.690
- Give me a rec, man, give
us a rec, it's your turn.

01:07:53.690 --> 01:07:56.760
- I'm gonna give a rec,
this is one of those things

01:07:56.760 --> 01:08:01.280
that many, many months behind
when everyone was talking

01:08:01.280 --> 01:08:02.680
about this thing but if you're like me,

01:08:02.680 --> 01:08:04.140
you didn't see it originally

01:08:05.314 --> 01:08:08.800
and I watched this movie on
the plane and so I'm gonna do

01:08:08.800 --> 01:08:12.253
a rec of Bo Burnham's Eighth Grade.

01:08:13.737 --> 01:08:15.910
For those of you who
have not taken the time

01:08:15.910 --> 01:08:19.740
to see this movie, I
just highly recommend it.

01:08:19.740 --> 01:08:24.740
It's just, there's something
about it that's so visceral,

01:08:25.010 --> 01:08:30.010
like the way that he puts
you into the experience

01:08:31.920 --> 01:08:36.920
of middle school in a way that
makes you feel uncomfortable

01:08:38.230 --> 01:08:42.613
and I don't ever feel that
way when I watch stuff.

01:08:43.910 --> 01:08:45.120
You know what I'm saying,
it's like, people talk about,

01:08:45.120 --> 01:08:48.220
I can't watch that 'cause it
makes me feel uncomfortable.

01:08:48.220 --> 01:08:51.374
And I wasn't about to stop
watching it but he's so effective

01:08:51.374 --> 01:08:56.374
and the lead actor in
this, whatever his name is,

01:08:56.660 --> 01:08:57.777
something Fisher, what her name is.

01:08:57.777 --> 01:08:59.650
I don't know what her name is.

01:08:59.650 --> 01:09:01.570
Look that up 'cause I
wanna get that right.

01:09:01.570 --> 01:09:05.360
The lead actor, the lead
actress in Eighth Grade.

01:09:05.360 --> 01:09:06.890
The way that, she's incredible.

01:09:06.890 --> 01:09:11.890
She just nails it so hard and
so that's just really cool

01:09:12.450 --> 01:09:15.343
to see somebody that
we knew from way back.

01:09:16.360 --> 01:09:18.910
We hung out with Bo Burnham
at YouTube Live back in

01:09:19.918 --> 01:09:22.430
2008, seven?

01:09:22.430 --> 01:09:23.750
- Probably eight.

01:09:23.750 --> 01:09:26.510
- And he was just a YouTuber, man.

01:09:26.510 --> 01:09:29.020
And he goes off and writes and
directs this incredible film

01:09:29.020 --> 01:09:30.930
so I know many of you
have probably seen it

01:09:30.930 --> 01:09:33.130
but a lot of you, probably
more of you are like me

01:09:33.130 --> 01:09:35.970
and you just didn't watch it
the first time it came out.

01:09:35.970 --> 01:09:37.791
I just highly recommend it.
- What's her name?

01:09:37.791 --> 01:09:40.570
- Elsie Fisher.
- Elsie Fisher.

01:09:40.570 --> 01:09:41.403
